ev('Mather Stability of C infinity mappings II infinitesimal stability implies stability','https://annals.math.princeton.edu/1969/89-2/p03','publisher metadata checked','Verified Annals 89(2), 254-291, DOI 10.2307/1970668; no abstract or full proof on opened publisher page.','Article metadata; corresponding account in Arnold 1968 sections 5-7 read separately','72')
ev('Mather nice dimensions 1971 Russian translation','https://www.mathnet.ru/php/getFT.phtml?jrnid=rm&option_lang=eng&paperid=4325&what=fullt','read the result','Full 1974 Russian translation of 1971 paper opened. Introduction gives proper-map condition and exact nice-dimension region including n=p<=8.','Printed pp. 129-131; original publication identified in first-page footnote','72')
ev('Mather Notes on Topological Stability 1970','https://webhomes.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/surgery/mather.pdf','read the result','Author notes opened; introduction states compact-source topological-stability density theorem as aim, with stratification and isotopy lemmas developed. Not falsely described as a read full proof of every germ-classification variant.','Introduction p. 2; sections 1-11','72,74')
ev('Arnold Singularities of smooth mappings Whitney cross ratio Levinson','https://www.mathnet.ru/php/getFT.phtml?jrnid=rm&option_lang=eng&paperid=5591&what=fullteng','read the result','Full 1968 author exposition opened, based on 1966 lectures. Exact square-plus-conjugate perturbation, Boardman and stability discussion, preparation, and Whitney five-factor counterexample found.','Examples 1-6 pp. 2-5; sections 2-3; sections 5-7; section 8 p. 39; references pp. 42-43','72,74,75')
